    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add To Wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/3cc6485a37b4b1cd19a885bbf4f71a81.poster.avif?t=1755594021\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/3cc6485a37b4b1cd19a885bbf4f71a81.webm?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/3cc6485a37b4b1cd19a885bbf4f71a81.mp4?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Chain Blasts &amp; Conquer Mind Mazes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Coco, a kitten with unique blasting powers. From flower fields to ancient ruins with unique explosions boxes, use pipe-squeezing explosions to break through mazes and collect fish treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a05b7e74a95aa47275393c24348f7817.poster.avif?t=1755594021\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a05b7e74a95aa47275393c24348f7817.webm?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a05b7e74a95aa47275393c24348f7817.mp4?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Box-Pushing Puzzles &amp; Collect All Fishes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the pipes and walls in the environment to push the boxes and solve the puzzles, without missing a single dried fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/b81b9a7aaeefc3313f21bed1b88d6d16.poster.avif?t=1755594021\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/b81b9a7aaeefc3313f21bed1b88d6d16.webm?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/b81b9a7aaeefc3313f21bed1b88d6d16.mp4?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Chain Blasts &amp; Conquer Mind Mazes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Coco, a kitten with unique blasting powers. From flower fields to ancient ruins with unique explosions boxes, use pipe-squeezing explosions to break through mazes and collect fish treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a05b7e74a95aa47275393c24348f7817.poster.avif?t=1755594021\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a05b7e74a95aa47275393c24348f7817.webm?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/a05b7e74a95aa47275393c24348f7817.mp4?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Box-Pushing Puzzles &amp; Collect All Fishes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the pipes and walls in the environment to push the boxes and solve the puzzles, without missing a single dried fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/b81b9a7aaeefc3313f21bed1b88d6d16.poster.avif?t=1755594021\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/b81b9a7aaeefc3313f21bed1b88d6d16.webm?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739300/extras/b81b9a7aaeefc3313f21bed1b88d6d16.mp4?t=1755594021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Cat Squeeze is a cozy, brain-teasing cat puzzle game. Playing as an explosive kitten, use the extrusion of the pipeline, and navigate a maze to collect fish treats! Solve puzzles with precise blasts to escape, or get trapped by the soft maze.",
